# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target
/dist/
*.jks
*.keystore
.DS_Store

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# 运行日志与本地工作数据
*.log
.workbuddy/

# `nsh check|build|package` 生成的 runner 源码、类型与产物（见 skills/nsh/references/tooling.md）。
# 在 crate 目录里跑 Cargo 还会生成嵌套的 target/，`/target` 只忽略仓库根那一个。
.nsh/
packages/*/target/
